@startuml uc-phy-04-activity
title UC-PHY-04 – Activity diagram (main flow + 2a, 5a, 6a)\nC7 sescam-diagnostics v1.1.0
skinparam shadowing false

|Physician (client)|
start
note right
  Preconditions: physician authenticated (SSO);
  procedure executed in UC-PHY-05 (EXECUTED_PENDING_REPORT);
  images archived in departmental RIS/PACS.
end note
|Server|
:1. List executed procedures for reporting worklist\n(with draft/finalized report status if any);
|Physician (client)|
:Select executed procedure and request DICOM study;
|Server|
:2. Query RIS/PACS via C-FIND / WADO-RS;
if (2a. PACS reachable?) then (no)
  :Audit PACS_CONNECTION_FAILED;
  |Physician (client)|
  :Show PACS connection failure alert;
  stop
else (yes)
  |Server|
  :Return DicomStudyDTO (metadata + WADO viewer token);
endif
|Physician (client)|
:3. Render image series in DICOM viewer;
:4. Open diagnostic reporting editor;
:5. Author findings & conclusions\n(and optional FollowUpRecommendation / critical alert);
if (Save mode?) then (5a. Save as draft)
  |Server|
  :Validate physician role + draft payload;
  :Persist report with status DRAFT\n(no EHR sync, no patient notification);
  :Audit REPORT_DRAFT_SAVED;
  |Physician (client)|
  :Display draft saved confirmation;
  stop
elseif (6. Finalize & digitally sign) then (yes)
  |Server|
  :Validate role, non-blank findings/conclusion,\nand digital signature;
  if (Valid & not already finalized?) then (no)
    :Audit REPORT_REJECTED;
    |Physician (client)|
    :Show validation or state conflict error;
    stop
  else (yes)
    :Persist DiagnosticReport with status FINALIZED\nand digital signature;
    :7. Export FHIR DiagnosticReport to Hospital EHR\n(record SYNCED or FAILED_SYNC visibly);
    :Publish ReportAvailabilityEvent (for patient notification);
    :Audit REPORT_FINALIZED (+ EHR sync outcome);
    |Physician (client)|
    :8. Display finalization & EHR sync confirmation;
    if (6a. Issue post-signature addendum?) then (yes)
      :Enter addendum reason, content & signature;
      |Server|
      :Append ReportAddendum preserving original signature\n(status -> AMENDED);
      :Re-export FHIR DiagnosticReport & publish update event;
      :Audit REPORT_ADDENDUM_ISSUED;
      |Physician (client)|
      :Display addendum confirmation;
    else (no)
    endif
    stop
  endif
endif
@enduml
